vis-optmem
Copyright 2026 Blockether

vis-optmem uses the design and the file format of OptMem by Victor Taelin:
https://github.com/VictorTaelin/OptMem

The design includes the dated memory log, the tree of summaries and the fixed-size
view that wake shows. vis-optmem is an independent Python implementation. It contains
no OptMem source code or text.
